      <Comment source="O-28, pujar">A cDNA clone was isolated from EST database of |FRAME: TAX-3702 &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;|, by complementation test with |FRAME: K+ K&lt;SUP&gt;+&lt;/SUP&gt;| uptake deficient Yeast, similarly in E.coli mutants. Followed by expression in Xenopus oocytes and transgenic Arabidopsis. This gene called KUP1 was shown to be high-affinity |FRAME: K+ K&lt;SUP&gt;+&lt;/SUP&gt;| uptake transporter in vivo. This gene is part of big gene family that encodes a family of K+ transporters |CITS: [12376644]|.</Comment>
